{"2472820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hunt Grounds", "steam_appid": 2472820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive atmospheric solo and co-op horror scenarios while being hunted by unnatural entities in Hunt Grounds. <br>Each scenario features unique locations, objectives, and supernatural threats designed around tension, exploration, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each scenario features unique locations, objectives, and supernatural threats designed around tension, exploration, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472820/extras/2e805921d56a1230d3d3354be40f20c7.poster.avif?t=1785931563\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472820/extras/2e805921d56a1230d3d3354be40f20c7.webm?t=1785931563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472820/extras/2e805921d56a1230d3d3354be40f20c7.mp4?t=1785931563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solo &amp; Co-op Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or with a friend as you navigate immersive horror scenarios filled with environmental interaction, hidden paths, and dangerous encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide from roaming entities, search abandoned locations, unlock new areas, and survive long enough to escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo and co-op horror gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric survival horror scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental interaction and puzzle solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiding and exploration mechanic